  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HO Civ Soc Peacebuilding Thematic Area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCA global support, coordination and development of the Peacebuilding thematic area. 
Essential components include facilitation of NCA&apos;s community of practice for cross-country learning, development and implementation of global policies and tools, and participation in networks.

The Norwegian Church Aid&#x2019;s civil society programme is implemented through 17 country programmes in Africa, Asia, the Middle East and Latin America. The country programmes are supported by regional and global advocacy programmes, strengthening local engagement in regional and global action.</narrative>
  </description>
